  "conclusions": [
    "The unchanged staged double-array probe fails in all three bracketing batches: 4/15 overall. The tagged and int32 diagnostic variants each pass 10/10.",
    "Failures occur at iterations 6641, 721, 7881 and 5491, all immediately after a timer yield. Slots 4 and 1 each fail twice. In every capture all staged scalar values reread 2048 while one array slot and the consumed local are positive zero.",
